MEWATI TUNE PLAYER — FINAL CONSOLIDATED FIX LIST
(Dono AI ki lists verify karke merge kiya gaya — false positives hataye gaye)

═══════════════════════════
🔴 CRITICAL
═══════════════════════════

1. lib/app.dart (line ~113) + lib/core/widgets/debug_panel.dart (line ~20-21)
   Problem: DebugPanel har build (release included) mein render ho raha hai, 
   kDebugMode gate jaan-bujh kar hataya gaya hai. Real users ko debug logs dikhte hain.
   Fix: `const DebugPanel(),` ko `if (kDebugMode) const DebugPanel(),` se replace karo.

2. sql/setup_likes.sql (increment_like_count / decrement_like_count functions)
   Problem: In RPC functions mein koi auth check nahi hai. Koi bhi anon user seedha 
   RPC call karke like_count ko manipulate kar sakta hai — bina actual like insert kiye.
   Fix: Function ke andar `IF auth.uid() IS NULL THEN RAISE EXCEPTION` daalo, 
   ya better: trigger use karo `AFTER INSERT/DELETE ON likes` jo automatically 
   count update kare — client/RPC se direct increment hatao.

3. lib/services/like_service.dart (addLike, removeLike — line ~39-56)
   Problem: likes table insert/delete aur like_count update do alag network calls 
   hain, atomic nahi. Ek fail ho jaye to like_count desync ho jata hai permanently.
   Fix: Ek Postgres trigger/function banao jo insert+increment ek hi transaction 
   mein kare (upar wale fix #2 ke sath combine ho sakta hai).

4. lib/providers/likes_provider.dart (toggleLike — line ~105)
   Problem: Double-tap pe koi in-flight lock nahi hai, race condition se local 
   aur server state mismatch ho sakta hai.
   Fix: Per-songId "already toggling" set rakho, duplicate call ignore karo jab 
   tak pehla request complete na ho.

5. lib/main.dart (_initializeApp) + lib/screens/splash/splash_screen.dart (line ~25)
   Problem: Splash sirf fixed 2-second timer pe wait karta hai, real Supabase 
   init background mein async chal raha hota hai. Slow network pe init 2 sec 
   se zyada le to authProvider.loadCurrentUser() Supabase client ready hone se 
   pehle call ho sakta hai → exception.
   Fix: Ek Future/completer banao jo _initializeApp complete hone par resolve 
   ho; splash usko await kare, fixed timer pe depend na kare.

═══════════════════════════
🟡 MEDIUM
═══════════════════════════

6. lib/providers/likes_provider.dart (_loadLikedSongs, _loadLikeCounts — line ~57-85)
   Problem: N+1 query problem — 50 songs ke liye 50+ alag API calls (ek-ek 
   song ke liye separate query loop mein). Supabase bill aur latency badhti hai.
   Fix: Batch RPC banao (jaise `get_likes_batch(song_ids uuid[])`) jo ek call 
   mein saare likes + counts return kare.

7. lib/services/favorites_service.dart (fetchFavoriteSongs — line ~59-96)
   Problem: `.select()` use ho raha hai bina `singers(name)` join ke — 
   songs_service.dart ke `.select('*, singers(name)')` se inconsistent. 
   Favorites screen pe singer name "Unknown Artist" dikhega.
   Fix: `.select()` ko `.select('*, singers(name)')` karo, aur Song.fromJson 
   mein singer name properly map karo.

8. Cloudflare R2 audio URLs — public/unsigned
   Problem: Poore codebase mein kahin bhi signed/expiring URL logic nahi mili. 
   Audio URLs seedhe direct-access hain — koi bhi link copy karke gaana 
   download/share kar sakta hai, poori library scrape ho sakti hai.
   Fix: R2 bucket private karo, Supabase Edge Function se short-lived 
   (15 min) signed URL generate karke client ko do.

9. lib/providers/songs_provider.dart (loadMoreSongs — line ~94)
   Problem: Har pagination call pe poori accumulated song list SharedPreferences 
   mein re-save hoti hai — library badhne pe slow ho jayega.
   Fix: Cache sirf first page pe karo ya periodic interval pe, ya 
   SharedPreferences ki jagah sqflite/Hive use karo.

10. lib/services/downloads_service.dart (line ~104-110)
    Problem: Download complete hone ka check sirf "file exists + size > 0" 
    hai, content verify nahi hota — corrupt/partial download bhi valid maan liya jata hai.
    Fix: Expected Content-Length se match karo ya checksum verify karo.

11. lib/services/downloads_service.dart (line ~45)
    Problem: songId directly file path mein interpolate ho raha hai, koi validation nahi.
    Fix: songId ko UUID regex se validate karo path banane se pehle.

12. lib/services/player_service.dart (line ~132)
    Problem: Play count turant increment ho jata hai setPlaylist call hote hi, 
    chahe actual playback fail ho jaye — inflated counts.
    Fix: Play count sirf playback actually shuru hone (kuch seconds play) ke baad increment karo.

13. sql/setup_likes.sql (line ~18 — "Users can view all likes" policy)
    Problem: `FOR SELECT USING (true)` — koi bhi user dekh sakta hai kisne 
    kya like kiya hai. Minor privacy leak.
    Fix: `FOR SELECT USING (auth.uid() = user_id)` karo, ya likes ko public 
    mat rakho — sirf like_count public rahe.

