14. lib/services/songs_service.dart (fetchAllSongs — line ~26)
    Problem: Dead code hai — kahin call nahi hota, but agar future mein use 
    hua to no-limit query hai, bade dataset pe hang kar sakta hai.
    Fix: Ya to function delete karo, ya usmein bhi pagination limit lagao.

15. lib/main.dart (line ~81)
    Problem: `Connectivity().onConnectivityChanged.listen((_) {})` — empty, 
    unused, never cancelled subscription.
    Fix: Hatao ya connectivity_banner widget se actually connect karo.

16. lib/services/downloads_service.dart (line ~117)
    Problem: print() use ho raha hai release build mein bhi console output ke liye.
    Fix: debugPrint() se replace karo.

17. lib/services/auth_service.dart (line ~32) + premium_gate.dart
    Problem: subscription_status client-side default set hota hai; jab premium 
    feature banega, ye field client se writable nahi hona chahiye.
    Fix: subscription_status sirf server-side (webhook/RLS policy) se update ho.

18. lib/config/supabase_config.dart (line ~6-7)
    Problem: Dev fallback URL/anon key hardcoded hai code mein.
    Fix: Hardcoded fallback hatao, sirf .env se load karo (anon key public 
    hone ke liye designed hai Supabase mein, RLS hi real protection hai — 
    isliye ye critical nahi, sirf cleanup hai).

